@Planning.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5289

### Create organization (anonymous)
POST {{Planning.Api_HostAddress}}/api/organizations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme Planning BV",
  "email": "info@acme.com"
}

### Get development JWT
# @name auth
POST {{Planning.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "dev-user",
  "email": "owner@acme.com",
  "organizationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### Create user
POST {{Planning.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "firstName": "Luuk",
  "lastName": "Planner",
  "email": "luuk@acme.com",
  "role": "Planner"
}

### Create customer
POST {{Planning.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "name": "Customer One",
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+31612345678",
  "notes": "Preferred morning appointments"
}

### Get week planning
GET {{Planning.Api_HostAddress}}/api/planning/week?organizationId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001&weekStartUtc=2026-06-23T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.accessToken}}
